<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In A Multi-Agent LLM Defense Pipeline Against Prompt Injection Attacks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">VI </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Defense Architecture Effectiveness</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
