</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">School of Computing, Wichita State University, Kansas, USA</span>Emails: sxhossain10@shockers.wichita.edu, rxshayoni@shockers.wichita.edu
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Mohd Ruhul Ameen
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">College of Engineering and Computer Sciences, Marshall University, Huntington, WV, USA</span>Email: ameen@marshall.edu
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
